{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《黃道益活絡油呈獻：愛·回家之開心速遞》播出的第2853集「零零七的終極任務」，好久不見的潮偉（袁文傑飾）霸氣回歸。劇情講述金城安（周嘉洛飾）遇上連環「童話式意外」（如毒蘋果、玻璃鞋等）而疑神疑鬼。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">另一邊廂，潮偉回歸與熊家眾人團聚，自稱遭特務學校解僱並主動協助安仔送貨，途中貨車卻失控墮海，令安仔懷疑潮偉對自己不利，事件更牽涉熊尚善（滕麗名飾）。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f425d22e-83b9-4baf-a5f7-7c0ed28db125.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026zNuPujQ7KP1784779420.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f425d22e-83b9-4baf-a5f7-7c0ed28db125.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"714f4a52-8d63-43ba-a4d4-f78210f601e3.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026LgSHMzCa171784779424.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"714f4a52-8d63-43ba-a4d4-f78210f601e3.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">亮點除了袁文傑的型爆特務造型外，他更會與滕麗名上演極其甜蜜的「肉麻錫手手」場面。至於搞笑擔當周嘉洛除會穿上「玻璃波鞋」大跳「停不了的勁舞」外，還會與「媽咪」滕麗名上演「浪漫欠奉，爆笑十足」的「母子壁咚」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-24T01:20:01.352709+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":277,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}